{"architectures":["x64"],"id":"nabdev.iloader","latestVersion":"2.4.1","media":{"icons":[],"screenshots":[]},"package":{"description":"iloader is a free and open-source iOS sideloading companion designed to make installing SideStore and other IPA apps as easy as possible.","license":"MIT","licenseUrl":"https://github.com/nab138/iloader/blob/HEAD/LICENSE","locale":"en-US","localizations":{"en-US":{"description":"iloader is a free and open-source iOS sideloading companion designed to make installing SideStore and other IPA apps as easy as possible.","license":"MIT","licenseUrl":"https://github.com/nab138/iloader/blob/HEAD/LICENSE","locale":"en-US","longDescription":"iloader is a free and open-source iOS sideloading companion designed to make installing SideStore and other IPA apps as easy as possible.\n\nFeatures\n- Supports Windows, Linux, and macOS\n- Automatically installs and helps setup SideStore\n- Place RPPairing and Lockdown Pairing files into apps like StikDebug or Protokolle\n- Get intelligent fixes/suggestions for common errors\n- Install any IPA application\n- See and manage development certificates and App IDs\n- Open source and MIT licensed\n- Localized into multiple languages\n- View and export logs\n- Connect to devices wirelessly or via USB\n- And more!","moniker":"iloader","name":"iloader","packageUrl":"https://iloader.app/","publisher":"nabdev","publisherUrl":"https://iloader.app/","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/nab138/iloader/releases/tag/v2.4.1","tags":["idevice","ios","sideloading","sidestore"]}},"longDescription":"iloader is a free and open-source iOS sideloading companion designed to make installing SideStore and other IPA apps as easy as possible.\n\nFeatures\n- Supports Windows, Linux, and macOS\n- Automatically installs and helps setup SideStore\n- Place RPPairing and Lockdown Pairing files into apps like StikDebug or Protokolle\n- Get intelligent fixes/suggestions for common errors\n- Install any IPA application\n- See and manage dev